id: pm-zk67yf
title: "GH-1215: Preserve original source maps through aliased build roots"
description: Nightly macOS Node 24 run 34104192850 loses original.ts source-map attribution during runtime compaction. Reproduce filesystem root aliases and preserve composed original source mapping across repeated compaction.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-07T13:35:08.919Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-07T13:58:47.403Z"
